<title>GERMANY: Colonia 1996 net profit up 12.4 pct.</title>
<headline>Colonia 1996 net profit up 12.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>COLOGNE, Germany 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calendar 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Group net profit			   236     vs 210</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit		     444     vs 405</p>
<p>    Group gross premium income	     10,811  vs 10,148</p>
<p>    Group DVFA earnings per share	  9.75    vs 9.30 dmk</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German insurer is Colonia Konzern Aktiengesellschaft.</p>
<p>The company also said that in the first quarter of 1997, premium income rose by 3.5 percent to 3.7 billion marks.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
